# The champion with the dive armed (dive 3): a party of the three
# FASTEST gathered units closes on the visible enemy ground mover whose
# land gun outranges every land gun the army fields, nearest the party
# (rw_bot.policy.dive, the outranged clause's own membership test
# lifted). Built from the loss-table anatomy of pinbase48 (log
# 2026-09-13): every opener seed is the scout-plus-artillery opening,
# the army stalls at eleven to thirteen pieces trading into 290-reach
# guns behind the screen while the enemy's income compounds, and every
# composition answer measured flat. No memory fallback and no lesser
# objective: with no outranging gun in sight the party stands down and
# none is raised, so a zero-artillery seed is the champion's match bit
# for bit -- the identity half of dive16 measures exactly that. Three is
# the engine's own first-group size, the hunt's and the raid's default.
# Every other knob and every goals slot is the champion's exactly.
name evolve1-g4m2-dive3
goals extractorT1,extractorT1,extractorT1,c_tank,c_tank,c_tank,heavyTank,hoverTank
heavies heavyTank,heavyTank
max_workers 8
mass 25
reserve -1
guard_cap 0
raid 3
tech 1
